    {
      "num": 2,
      "geez": "ወደወየ፡ አካዝያስ፡ ወሰከበ፡ ውስተ፡ ጽርሑ፡ በሰማርያ፡ ወለአከ፡ ሐዋርያተ፡ ወይቤሎሙ፡ ሑሩ፡ ተሰአሉ፡ ሊተ፡ ኀበ፡\n            በዓለ፡ ጽንጽንያ፡ አምላከ፡ አቃሮን፡ ለእመ፡ አሐዩ፡ እምዛቲ፡ ደዌ፡ ወሖሩ፡ ይስአሉ፡ ሎቱ።",
      "translation": "And Ochozias fell through the lattice that was in his upper chamber in Samaria, and was sick; and he sent messengers, and said to them, Go and enquire of Baal fly, the god of Accaron, whether I shall recover of this my sickness. And they went to enquire of him.",
